WEBVTT

00:00:12.533 --> 00:00:15.711
OCTOBER SEVENTEENTH, NINETEEN NINETY SIX.

00:00:15.711 --> 00:00:19.549
THE SURVIVOR IS EVA EIZENBERG, E.V.A.

00:00:19.549 --> 00:00:23.090
E.I.Z.E.N.B.E.R.G.

00:00:23.147 --> 00:00:25.810
THE INTERVIEWER IS FAY NICOLL.

00:00:25.810 --> 00:00:27.928
THE LANGUAGE IS YIDDISH

00:00:27.928 --> 00:00:29.502
TAPE THREE.

00:00:30.522 --> 00:00:34.245
ir zent ongekumen in MOGILEV PODOLSK.

00:00:33.103 --> 00:00:35.898
dos iz geven MOGILEV PODOLSK.

00:00:36.040 --> 00:00:40.607
fun MOGILEV hot men undz getribn vayter kolones

00:00:40.647 --> 00:00:42.700
s'hobn zikh tsun undz

00:00:42.958 --> 00:00:48.386
m'hot undz tsunoyfgeshtelt mit andere yidn fun andere shtet, vayzt oys.

00:00:48.510 --> 00:00:53.836
ven, ven m'hot aykh tsuzamengeshtelt, vos hot ir gehert fun di andere yidn?

00:00:54.906 --> 00:00:58.595
vos, m'hot, itlekher hot gebetn got az me zol nisht hargenen.

00:00:59.277 --> 00:01:03.692
m'hot ge- gevust az me shikt undz oyf tsu hargenen, oyf tsu mutshen

00:01:03.748 --> 00:01:05.635
un m'hot shoyn gevust fun gazn

00:01:05.635 --> 00:01:09.145
m'hot shoyn gevust az s'iz shoyn do gazn vos di daytshn

00:01:09.145 --> 00:01:10.914
dishen mentshn.

00:01:10.858 --> 00:01:13.546
vi azoy hot ir, hot men dos gevust?

00:01:14.802 --> 00:01:17.462
dos veys ikh nisht. se git zikh iber.

00:01:17.772 --> 00:01:20.370
un dos iz geven nayntsn eyn un fertsik?

00:01:20.117 --> 00:01:23.587
dos iz shoyn geven ende eyn un fertsik.

00:01:23.610 --> 00:01:27.299
hot men shoyn gevust az di daytshn nitsn di gaz.

00:01:24.910 --> 00:01:27.486
m'hot gevust. m'hot gevust.

00:01:28.470 --> 00:01:32.497
di mentshn vos zenen geven mit undz hobn shoyn gevust.

00:01:34.343 --> 00:01:40.406
m'hot undz gesh- vayter. m'hot tsunam- tsuzamengenumen a s- mer mentshn, vayl

00:01:40.406 --> 00:01:43.331
me falt un me shist un me harget un me shlogt

00:01:43.337 --> 00:01:46.517
iz vos a mol ver veyniker, in, in MOGILEV

00:01:46.517 --> 00:01:49.597
hot men undz shoyn tsuzamengenumen mit, fun andere shtet

00:01:49.598 --> 00:01:52.697
un s'iz gevorn a gute, sheyne kolone

00:01:52.787 --> 00:01:54.637
un m'hot getribn vayter.

00:01:56.044 --> 00:02:00.712
m'hot getribn in, a groyse

00:02:00.769 --> 00:02:02.571
a sakh mentshn

00:02:02.571 --> 00:02:04.217
hot men opgeshtelt

00:02:04.217 --> 00:02:09.977
in dem shtetl in Ukrayne. dos shtetl hot geheysn Kopaygorod.

00:02:10.646 --> 00:02:15.123
ikh meyn az dos shtetl iz geve- hot got fargesn fun dem shtetl

00:02:15.214 --> 00:02:19.190
vayl aza min UNK un aza min shmuts un aza min

00:02:19.298 --> 00:02:21.874
oremkeyt mit aza min

00:02:22.183 --> 00:02:27.492
s'iz, s'iz, ikh, s'iz geven, s'iz nisht geven ⟨oyf⟩ vos un vemen tsu kukn.

00:02:28.174 --> 00:02:32.893
dortn hot men undz opgeshtelt. dortn iz geven a geto.

00:02:33.186 --> 00:02:34.833
Kopaygorod.

00:02:35.481 --> 00:02:39.553
dortn iz geven TRANSNISTRIA.

00:02:39.553 --> 00:02:42.253
dos hot geheysn dos shtikl plats

00:02:42.253 --> 00:02:45.009
vos di daytshn hobn avekgegibn ANTONESCU

00:02:46.876 --> 00:02:50.274
az er zol tun dortn vos er vil mit di, mit di yidn.

00:02:51.259 --> 00:02:53.180
s'iz geven a CLOACA.

00:02:53.180 --> 00:02:54.223
a, a

00:02:54.398 --> 00:02:57.272
s'iz, s'iz nisht tsu bashraybn.

00:02:57.272 --> 00:02:59.876
ikh meyn az keyner ken dos nisht bashraybn.

00:02:59.950 --> 00:03:01.676
m'hot undz

00:03:01.676 --> 00:03:06.536
tsetribn in di yidishe shtiber. s'iz dortn geven di, di, di Ukrayner yidn

00:03:06.536 --> 00:03:10.670
vos ⟨zey hobn⟩ nokh gelebt dortn. a sakh zenen antlofn. a sakh zenen geven.

00:03:10.670 --> 00:03:13.342
dortn iz geven di Ukraynishe politsey

00:03:13.500 --> 00:03:16.531
un s'iz geven di rumenishe soldatn.

00:03:18.782 --> 00:03:24.463
dortn iz geven nokh der shtot

00:03:24.537 --> 00:03:26.876
iz shoyn geven epes a mh

00:03:27.523 --> 00:03:30.515
⟨GRANICERN⟩ hobn zey geheysn.

00:03:30.515 --> 00:03:33.170
oyf HEBREW heyst dos BITACHON.

00:03:33.396 --> 00:03:36.900
s'iz geven rumenishe soldatn un ofitsirn a sakh.

00:03:36.940 --> 00:03:38.925
es iz geven politsey.

00:03:39.117 --> 00:03:41.693
rumenishe politsey

00:03:41.749 --> 00:03:44.763
un zey hobn zikh gut noykem geven.

00:03:46.963 --> 00:03:52.571
dort iz ANTONESCU iz geven der balebos, nor s'iz do a got oyf der velt. dernokh dem, nokh der milkhome

00:03:52.571 --> 00:03:56.120
hobn mir zikh dervust az in Rumenye hot men dem ANTONESCU geharget.

00:03:58.978 --> 00:04:03.697
hungerik, shleferik, shmuts. s'iz nisht tsu fargesn.

00:04:07.956 --> 00:04:10.667
mayn mame iz geshtorbn fun hunger.

00:04:13.930 --> 00:04:17.704
mayn mame iz geven a froy fun a por un fuftsik yor. zi iz geshtorbn fun hunger.

00:04:18.603 --> 00:04:25.027
dos yingele fun mayn shvester, er iz geven a fir monat iz er shoyn geven, vayzt oys

00:04:25.152 --> 00:04:29.786
iz geshtorbn fun tifus. mir hobn ale ibergelebt tifus.

00:04:30.231 --> 00:04:33.431
m'iz gelign. m'hot zikh gevalgert oyf di

00:04:34.517 --> 00:04:39.388
oyf di brikn naket un borves, un di, di layz hobn oyfgegesn.

00:04:43.528 --> 00:04:47.673
undz hot men geshikt oyf shvere arbetn. vos zenen geven di arbetn?

00:04:47.730 --> 00:04:50.187
shlepn shteyner

00:04:50.278 --> 00:04:52.803
vi vayt di berger zenen hekher

00:04:52.860 --> 00:04:55.709
sh- shlepn un trogn

00:04:55.709 --> 00:04:56.938
shteyner

00:04:56.995 --> 00:04:59.008
tualetn

00:04:59.008 --> 00:05:00.295
shmuts

00:05:00.353 --> 00:05:03.893
reyn makhn di kien mit di khazeyrim mit di

00:05:03.893 --> 00:05:05.105
mit di ferd

00:05:05.348 --> 00:05:08.801
shlogn hargenen. di gantse tsayt hot men geshlogn.

00:05:10.022 --> 00:05:14.043
zey zenen ale umgegangen mit nagaykes

00:05:14.043 --> 00:05:15.804
vi baytshlekh azoyne.

00:05:15.895 --> 00:05:19.129
di ale baytshlekh zenen geven gemakht fun

00:05:21.717 --> 00:05:23.584
vos me makht shikh.

00:05:23.267 --> 00:05:24.187
leder.

00:05:23.640 --> 00:05:24.950
fun leder

00:05:25.547 --> 00:05:27.898
din azoyne

00:05:27.898 --> 00:05:31.636
un in ek fun di, di, di baytshlekh

00:05:31.636 --> 00:05:37.472
iz geven azoyne vi a ⟨veyer⟩ mh drotlekh, fun ayzerne drotlekh

00:05:38.035 --> 00:05:40.408
⟨iz⟩ zey hobn gut geshlogn

00:05:42.878 --> 00:05:43.766
zey

00:05:44.920 --> 00:05:48.474
un m'hot geshlogn mit di drotn, es fleg geyn blut.

00:05:52.395 --> 00:05:55.612
in der tsayt

00:05:56.007 --> 00:05:57.857
hob ikh mit mayn tatn

00:05:57.964 --> 00:05:59.628
zikh tsunoyfgeredt

00:06:01.896 --> 00:06:04.725
az mir zoln mir zikh aroysganvenen fun dem geto

00:06:05.575 --> 00:06:13.399
un epes geyn betn. mir hobn nisht gehat vos tsu baytn. betn, tsi epes arbetn, me zol, me zol undz gibn, zoln mir epes opesn.

00:06:15.818 --> 00:06:22.747
ikh gedenk zeyer gut vi ikh bin gegangen mit mayn tatn in UNK tsun a dorf

00:06:25.065 --> 00:06:30.999
iz s'iz shoyn geven fintst- efsher iz mir geven fintster in di oygn. es iz shoyn dakht zikh geven fintster

00:06:31.275 --> 00:06:35.791
mir zenen arayngegangen in a, in a, in a veldl, tsi s'iz geven a vald

00:06:37.030 --> 00:06:44.246
un plutsem hot zikh UNK gegibn a shtel avek tsvey rumenishe soldatn mit di bayonetn

00:06:45.282 --> 00:06:49.303
vi geveyntlekh shiker un, un khoyzek gemakht un

00:06:49.303 --> 00:06:51.097
un gelakht fun undz

00:06:51.745 --> 00:06:57.493
un hobn ongehoybn tsu fregn vu, vu ⟨kum ikh⟩, vi azoy zenen mir a- aroysgegangen fun dem geto?

00:06:58.107 --> 00:07:02.978
mayn tate hot, nisht gekent gut rumenish redn.

00:07:03.793 --> 00:07:06.971
ikh hob ongehoybn zey tsu, tsu erklern az in

00:07:06.971 --> 00:07:10.456
mir ze'mir aroysgan fun dem geto vayl mir zenen hungerik

00:07:10.456 --> 00:07:14.841
mir ze'mir gegangen zukhn epes, betn epes esn, me zol undz epes gibn

00:07:14.847 --> 00:07:16.123
epes arbet.

00:07:17.817 --> 00:07:20.842
ikh hob derfilt vi mayn tate

00:07:20.842 --> 00:07:22.906
drukt mir fest mayn hant.

00:07:24.634 --> 00:07:30.433
un zey hobn im onge- undz ongehoybn tsu tsetraybn, un mit di bayonetes hobn zey undz geshtokhn in di pleytses.

00:07:31.671 --> 00:07:34.719
un hobn geredt epes tsv- tsvishn zikh, ikh veys

00:07:41.138 --> 00:07:43.798
un, un plutsem iz

00:07:44.766 --> 00:07:47.375
mayn tate gefaln oyf di knies

00:07:47.652 --> 00:07:51.004
un hot zey ongehoybn tsu betn az

00:07:51.229 --> 00:07:52.657
oy, mayn got

00:07:54.165 --> 00:08:01.634
i- az undz, mikh zoln zey oplozn az ikh bin a kind, un ikh zol UNK geyn, un mit im zol men tun vos me vil.

00:08:03.683 --> 00:08:06.124
mikh hot er gehaltn fest bay der hant

00:08:06.248 --> 00:08:08.503
un mir hot er ongehoybn tsu shrayen

00:08:18.870 --> 00:08:22.019
hot ongehoybn tsu shrayen oyf yidish

00:08:22.937 --> 00:08:26.756
"antloyf, Khavele, antloyf. loyf, mayn kind.

00:08:26.756 --> 00:08:30.030
du darfst blaybn lebn. du darfst ales dertseyln

00:08:30.030 --> 00:08:33.056
antloyf, mayn kind. loyf gikher."

00:08:43.491 --> 00:08:44.818
ikh bin antlofn.

00:08:45.803 --> 00:08:50.235
un s'iz geven fintster. di beymer hobn mikh arumgeviklt.

00:08:51.456 --> 00:08:58.892
ikh gedenk nisht vifl ikh vil zikh nisht dermanen. ikh gedenk nisht tsi m'hot geshosn tsi m'hot nisht geshosn. I DON'T KNOW.

00:09:00.518 --> 00:09:04.494
ikh gedenk nor zeyer gut az ikh bin gelofn tsvishn di beymer

00:09:05.120 --> 00:09:07.256
un opgeshrign.

00:09:07.256 --> 00:09:11.090
ikh gedenk az ikh hob gehaltn in der hant epes a torbele, epes a

00:09:11.090 --> 00:09:14.814
epes a froy hot mir epes a, a goye hot mir epes gegibn vos tsu esn

00:09:14.814 --> 00:09:16.655
tsi s'iz geven frukhtn tsi vos.

00:09:16.655 --> 00:09:19.175
dos hob ikh zeyer fest gehaltn in der hant.

00:09:28.547 --> 00:09:30.110
ikh bin zikher

00:09:30.927 --> 00:09:35.781
ven me firt mikh itster tsu tsu yenem plats, volt ikh es gefinen.

00:09:36.107 --> 00:09:38.615
ikh bin aroysgegangen bay nakht

00:09:38.841 --> 00:09:40.168
oyfn veg.

00:09:41.085 --> 00:09:43.171
ikh gedenk dos plats.

00:09:43.937 --> 00:09:48.960
itster bay nakht, ven me firt mikh, volt ikh gefunen dem plats mit dem torbele

00:09:49.877 --> 00:09:52.723
i- nor vi azoy ikh bin gekumen in geto

00:09:53.320 --> 00:09:54.630
dos veys ikh nisht.

00:09:54.906 --> 00:09:56.520
dos gedenk ikh ⟨nisht⟩.

00:10:07.913 --> 00:10:09.868
vos hot pasirt tsu ayer tate?

00:10:10.870 --> 00:10:12.754
mayn tatn hob ikh mer nisht gezen.

00:10:13.435 --> 00:10:15.656
mayn tatn hob ikh mer nisht gezen.

00:10:17.198 --> 00:10:21.900
ikh veys biz haynt nisht vu zaynen beyner zenen, mayn tatn's beyner.

00:10:23.172 --> 00:10:25.764
vi alt zent ir geven yetst?

00:10:26.192 --> 00:10:27.384
zekhtsn.

00:10:30.462 --> 00:10:32.531
z- yo, zekhtsn.

00:10:34.242 --> 00:10:37.391
efsher bin ikh shoyn iber zibetsn, zekhtsn yor.

00:10:39.912 --> 00:10:41.239
I'M SORRY.

00:10:43.320 --> 00:10:48.390
in der tsayt hot men zikh, hobn mir zikh dervust tsi emetser hot undz

00:10:48.390 --> 00:10:51.576
dertseylt, tsi emetser hot ge- bafelt

00:10:51.576 --> 00:10:52.835
az

00:10:52.835 --> 00:10:56.522
nisht vayt fun Kopaygorod, ergets in ⟨balkes⟩

00:10:56.522 --> 00:11:01.404
iz do di mishpokhe der mame's vayzt oys

00:11:01.630 --> 00:11:02.636
eygene.

00:11:04.262 --> 00:11:06.348
mayn shvester LIZA

00:11:06.642 --> 00:11:11.867
hot mir gezogt "du zay shtil. du zits do. me muz geyn oyf arbet, un m'vet aykh shikn.

00:11:12.615 --> 00:11:17.097
ikh ⟨vel⟩ zikh aroysraysn, aroysganvenen fun dem geto

00:11:17.357 --> 00:11:22.637
un ikh vel geyn zukhn di, di eygene." efsher UNK tsuzamen ⟨zayn⟩ efsher

00:11:22.637 --> 00:11:26.495
vet men epes esn, epes ⟨veln zey mir⟩ gibn zakhn oyf tsu baytn.

00:11:26.517 --> 00:11:30.812
zey flegn araynkumen in Kopaygorod di goyim fun di derfer

00:11:30.812 --> 00:11:34.617
un ver s'hot gehat vos tsu baytn flegn baytn. mir ho'mir gornisht gehat. m'hot UNK

00:11:34.617 --> 00:11:36.931
s'iz geven ales tsugerabevet.

00:11:37.827 --> 00:11:41.128
un zi hot zikh aroysgerisn fun dem geto

00:11:45.488 --> 00:11:50.274
mh borves un naket un in zek. fun zek gemakht

00:11:50.415 --> 00:11:52.147
epes, epes kleyder.

00:11:52.542 --> 00:11:54.375
zenen mir ale gegangen in zek.

00:11:58.161 --> 00:12:02.222
un zi iz aroysgegangen bay nakht, iz zi aroysgegangen fun dem geto

00:12:07.003 --> 00:12:09.072
biz di andere nakht, dakht zikh mir.

00:12:09.214 --> 00:12:13.494
iz hobn zikh arayngerisn tsun undz rumenishe soldatn

00:12:13.534 --> 00:12:18.101
in dem podval vu mir ho'mir gevoynt, in der, der kamer.

00:12:18.850 --> 00:12:20.329
un m'hot mikh

00:12:20.723 --> 00:12:23.445
ts- oyfge- oyfgeshlept fun der breg

00:12:23.445 --> 00:12:26.235
un m'hot mir geheysn z- geyn mit zey in der politsey.

00:12:28.873 --> 00:12:29.899
eyner aleyn?

00:12:29.785 --> 00:12:30.639
yo.

00:12:31.523 --> 00:12:36.236
es iz geven dortn a sakh mentshn. s'iz, m'iz, s'iz, m'iz ale gelign vi, vi, vi

00:12:36.236 --> 00:12:38.688
vi khazeyrim, mir zenen gelign ale tsuzamen.

00:12:39.741 --> 00:12:43.290
m'hot mikh gebrakht in der politsey.

00:12:43.290 --> 00:12:46.755
der komandir fun der politsey di rumenishe

00:12:47.065 --> 00:12:48.780
iz geven a

00:12:49.478 --> 00:12:52.813
a alter a, a grober, an, a, a fa- a

00:12:52.887 --> 00:12:54.838
a farf- f- a f-

00:12:55.232 --> 00:12:56.570
a koytiker

00:12:56.570 --> 00:12:59.732
mit geshvolene oygn. er iz geven tomed shiker.

00:12:59.788 --> 00:13:01.992
mit der sheyner nagayke

00:13:02.404 --> 00:13:04.442
un er fleg

00:13:04.442 --> 00:13:05.941
hargenen un shlogn

00:13:06.690 --> 00:13:12.618
hargenen un shlogn, un fun dem moyl iz bay im nish- di, di letste, di shmutsike verter

00:13:12.618 --> 00:13:16.167
flegn keseyder bay im zayn oyfn moyl.

00:13:21.827 --> 00:13:24.976
m'hot mikh arayngebrakht in der politsey, in tsimer

00:13:25.557 --> 00:13:27.351
zogt er

00:13:27.351 --> 00:13:28.825
"vu iz dayn shvester?"

00:13:29.944 --> 00:13:32.401
zog ikh "zi iz ergets bay a khaverte."

00:13:32.779 --> 00:13:35.186
"vu iz ot di khave-" zog ikh "ikh veys nisht."

00:13:35.867 --> 00:13:38.876
"akh, du shmutsike

00:13:38.876 --> 00:13:41.534
du, du SCHWEINE, du, du yidishe

00:13:41.534 --> 00:13:42.066
du"

00:13:42.066 --> 00:13:44.445
mit di letste rumenishe verter

00:13:44.445 --> 00:13:47.150
vos ikh ken zey nisht aroys.

00:13:49.637 --> 00:13:51.825
"ay, du zogst nokh lign?

00:13:52.422 --> 00:13:55.082
du kenst nokh mir zogn lign?"

00:13:55.628 --> 00:13:59.014
mir gegibn a khap on bay der er, bay der, baym haldz

00:13:59.256 --> 00:14:03.041
un, un hot mir gezogt "itstert vestu bakumen finef un tsvantsik

00:14:03.041 --> 00:14:05.442
vestu dikh dermanen vu dayn shvester iz"

00:14:06.816 --> 00:14:09.425
un hot mikh mit gevald

00:14:12.773 --> 00:14:16.963
hot mikh ongeboygn oyf a taburet, ikh zol zikh, mit di hent zol ikh zikh

00:14:16.963 --> 00:14:19.044
onshparn in dem taburet.

00:14:19.270 --> 00:14:22.658
er hot anidergeshtelt dem, dem fus zaynem

00:14:22.658 --> 00:14:24.427
oykhet oyfn taburet

00:14:24.822 --> 00:14:26.571
un hot mikh ongehoybn tsu hargenen.

00:14:41.612 --> 00:14:44.748
mayne gvaldn zenen geven

00:14:44.748 --> 00:14:46.112
biz untern himl.

00:14:47.316 --> 00:14:51.832
kh'hob shtark geshrign, un kh'hob shtark geveynt. kh'hob gebetn me zol mir helfn

00:14:53.323 --> 00:14:55.983
un mayn ponem iz geven ful mit blut.

00:14:58.673 --> 00:15:00.692
keyner hot mir nisht gekent helfn.

00:15:01.727 --> 00:15:04.050
der geto iz geven nisht vayt.

00:15:04.596 --> 00:15:07.543
ikh meyn az mayne gvaldn hobn zikh gehert in geto.

00:15:09.979 --> 00:15:13.348
keyner hot mir nisht geholfn. s'hot ⟨dokh⟩ keyner nisht gekent helfn.

00:15:14.772 --> 00:15:17.241
un, ober er, di khaye

00:15:17.241 --> 00:15:20.548
hot azoy langzam, mit

00:15:20.548 --> 00:15:22.219
mit hanoe

00:15:22.219 --> 00:15:25.869
hot er mikh, yedes mol geharget un geshlogn

00:15:31.630 --> 00:15:33.294
keyner veyst nisht.

00:15:35.072 --> 00:15:39.659
vi azoy ikh, pletslekh bin ikh geven in dem

00:15:39.659 --> 00:15:44.009
podval vu zenen mir, vu mir ho'mir gelebt, in der kamer, in dem d- in der erd.

00:15:50.412 --> 00:15:52.313
mayn shvester hot mir dertseylt.

00:15:52.943 --> 00:15:54.877
m'hot mikh

00:15:54.985 --> 00:15:59.079
geviklt in shmates, in, mit kalte shmates un vaser

00:16:00.165 --> 00:16:04.158
un m'hot epes mit epes mir geshmirt, ikh veys nisht mit vos

00:16:04.688 --> 00:16:09.508
un mayn shvester hot mir dertseylt az keyner hot nisht gegleybt az ikh vel shoyn zayn a mentsh.

00:16:12.231 --> 00:16:17.034
un in lager iz ales umgegangen vi, vi m'hot ales oysgeharget.

00:16:19.842 --> 00:16:21.405
a lange tsayt.

00:16:22.018 --> 00:16:25.488
zeyer a lange tsayt hob ikh nisht gekent kumen tsu zikh

00:16:28.515 --> 00:16:33.723
un mayn shvester zogt az keyner hot nisht gegleybt. es iz geven epes a mh

00:16:33.723 --> 00:16:36.992
a dokter iz geven dortn in dem geto

00:16:36.992 --> 00:16:42.537
iz, iz er arayngekumen un, un hot zikh, un hot gezen di pley- un er hot zikh tseveynt.

00:16:42.537 --> 00:16:45.365
un iz aroysgegangen, un gezogt er ken gornisht tun.

00:16:50.014 --> 00:16:53.484
nor vos yo, un m'hot mikh mer nisht genumen oyf arbet.

00:16:54.570 --> 00:16:57.348
mer hot mikh nisht getribn un nisht genumen oyf arbet.

00:17:01.017 --> 00:17:04.386
in tsvey un fertsikstn yor iz dos shoyn geven.

00:17:06.753 --> 00:17:08.873
bin ikh epes, dos

00:17:09.150 --> 00:17:11.945
a yunger kerper kumt tsu, ikh bin geblibn lebn.

00:17:13.368 --> 00:17:19.470
m'hot bay mir tsugeganvet mayn- di shenste yorn mayne, di mayne yunge yorn di shenste

00:17:20.051 --> 00:17:22.188
tsugeganvet. far vos?

00:17:23.646 --> 00:17:27.588
mayn shvester LIZA, zi hot mikh nisht gelozt aleyn.

00:17:27.780 --> 00:17:32.077
zi fleg mit mir geyn un mikh nisht oplozn oyf eyn moment.

00:17:34.395 --> 00:17:37.072
in tsvey un fertsikstn yor

00:17:37.315 --> 00:17:40.515
iz in Kopaygorod gekumen a

00:17:40.808 --> 00:17:45.172
a daytshisher ofitsir, a, a, a groyser ofitsir a daytshisher

00:17:46.107 --> 00:17:48.801
un m'hot im gegibn a shtub

00:17:48.942 --> 00:17:54.370
un undz kinder, meydlekh, hot men geshikt reyn makhn

00:17:54.730 --> 00:17:56.614
shvartse, koytike arbet.

00:18:00.371 --> 00:18:03.127
ikh gedenk zeyer gut vi der ofitsir

00:18:03.252 --> 00:18:07.313
fleg oysshteln bay der vant akht meydlekh

00:18:08.668 --> 00:18:10.501
un s'hot gedarft zayn

00:18:10.508 --> 00:18:13.989
e- eyn linye. s'hot, m'hot nisht getort ar- fleg er mit der

00:18:13.989 --> 00:18:18.281
mit der nagayke fleg er hargenen di, di borvese fis.

00:18:19.165 --> 00:18:24.458
tsvishn di meydlekh hot gedarft zayn a interval fun a, fun a, fun eyn shpan

00:18:25.560 --> 00:18:28.237
er fleg zikh shteln vizavi

00:18:28.935 --> 00:18:30.583
un fleg shisn.

00:18:31.281 --> 00:18:34.481
er fleg shisn tsvishn tsvey kep

00:18:34.892 --> 00:18:37.518
az di pulye hot gedarft

00:18:37.677 --> 00:18:39.628
pinktlekh zayn in der mit

00:18:40.410 --> 00:18:42.024
tsvishn tsvey kep

00:18:44.224 --> 00:18:49.365
un vi geveyntlekh iz, fleg men khaleshn un, ir zolt mir moykhl zayn, me fleg

00:18:49.422 --> 00:18:50.732
zikh bamakhn

00:18:50.991 --> 00:18:53.229
un me fleg kvitshen un veynen.

00:18:55.125 --> 00:18:56.570
s-

00:18:57.285 --> 00:19:00.514
s'iz nisht tsum bashraybn dos ponem

00:19:00.514 --> 00:19:03.332
di oygn. dos, dos

00:19:03.332 --> 00:19:07.002
vi azoy er iz geven tsufridn, dos gelekhter zayns

00:19:07.002 --> 00:19:10.343
vi a, vi a khaye, vi er fleg lakhn

00:19:10.343 --> 00:19:14.373
un fleg shrayen "RAUS VON HIER. RAUS VON HIER."

00:19:14.683 --> 00:19:16.465
un m'hot gedarft brengen andere.

00:19:17.552 --> 00:19:21.089
andere meydlekh un zey shteln. er hot zey gelernt

00:19:21.366 --> 00:19:22.457
tsu shisn.

00:19:28.167 --> 00:19:29.831
ir gedenkt zayn nomen?

00:19:30.293 --> 00:19:32.194
OH NO. ikh gedenk di oygn.

00:19:33.229 --> 00:19:37.340
ikh gedenk zayne oygn. ikh vel shtarbn ⟨oyb ikh vel⟩ zen zayne oygn.

00:19:38.967 --> 00:19:42.555
neyn, ikh gedenk nisht zayn nomen. er iz geven a hoykher ofitsir.

00:19:43.000 --> 00:19:44.715
a kolonel, ikh veys nisht.

00:19:45.919 --> 00:19:50.958
der hoykh gebildeter ofitsir, der natsi S.S.

00:19:51.302 --> 00:19:54.148
hot gemakht in Kopaygorod a aktsye.

00:19:54.998 --> 00:19:57.776
un dos heyst in a bay nakht.

00:19:58.423 --> 00:20:01.626
hot men aroysgetribn di sheyne skeletn

00:20:01.626 --> 00:20:03.193
di naket un borvese

00:20:03.267 --> 00:20:07.311
in a veldele ergets in Kopaygorod, tsi s'iz aroys Kopaygorod

00:20:08.312 --> 00:20:14.010
dos iz geven spetsyel gemakht az di vos zey dekhen nokh ⟨epes⟩ zol men zey hargenen.

00:20:14.218 --> 00:20:18.155
un vos s'iz UNK s'iz geven vos ⟨tsu rabeven, tserabeven⟩

00:20:18.155 --> 00:20:21.502
un khoyzek makhn oyf di yidishe kinder, di meydlekh.

00:20:23.989 --> 00:20:25.130
s'iz geve-

00:20:24.006 --> 00:20:28.708
s'iz nokh gek- antshuldikt, s'iz nokh geven demolst eltere mentshn?

00:20:28.748 --> 00:20:30.041
zeyer veynik.

00:20:30.587 --> 00:20:34.684
s'iz geven, itstert farshtey ikh az s'iz geven, vayzt oys

00:20:34.684 --> 00:20:39.696
az ikh bin gevo- -ven ⟨nor⟩ zekhtsn yor, iz di mentshn zenen geven, vayzt oys, draysik

00:20:39.696 --> 00:20:45.720
finef u- azoyne mentshn. UNK m'hot nisht gekent UNK, keyn kinder, keyn kleyne kinder zenen b- g- bikhlal nisht geven.

00:20:45.720 --> 00:20:46.966
shoyn nisht geven.

00:20:47.226 --> 00:20:52.198
un, un di yunge mentshn zenen oykh geven skeletn. s'iz oykh nisht geven, s'iz geven khayes.

00:20:52.558 --> 00:20:54.512
me fleg geyn, un, un

00:20:54.512 --> 00:20:56.991
un, vi meshugoim un lakhn un

00:20:57.013 --> 00:21:00.756
in dem Kopaygorod iz geven in mitn dem plats

00:21:00.756 --> 00:21:02.731
iz geven gemakht tualetn

00:21:02.731 --> 00:21:03.656
ofene

00:21:04.287 --> 00:21:08.148
ir zolt mir moykhl zayn az ver s'hot zikh gedarft

00:21:08.148 --> 00:21:12.678
bafrid- iz geven ofn. ir hot gekukt ⟨tsu zey ales geyen⟩ naket, naket

00:21:12.678 --> 00:21:16.042
un me zitst un ir zolt mir moykhl zayn, me makht vos me darf.

00:21:16.302 --> 00:21:20.323
un der shtunk iz geven, s'iz nisht tsu f- tsu, ibertsugebn.

00:21:20.323 --> 00:21:23.308
un oyf di gasn umedum, di sheyne gasn dortn

00:21:23.308 --> 00:21:26.591
iz umedum iz geven tinef. me fleg geyn oyf tinef.

00:21:26.591 --> 00:21:29.773
gebrokhene, s'iz geven kranke, s'iz geven

00:21:29.773 --> 00:21:30.689
s-

00:21:33.666 --> 00:21:34.554
s'iz

00:21:34.965 --> 00:21:36.598
s'iz ummeglekh

00:21:36.598 --> 00:21:40.165
ibertsugibn, UNK me ken es nisht bashraybn. keyn, keyn

00:21:40.165 --> 00:21:42.866
normaler mentsh ken dos nisht farshteyn.

00:21:46.592 --> 00:21:49.083
iz di aktsye iz geven

00:21:49.090 --> 00:21:53.151
oyf tsu hargenen un, un kh- khoyzek makhn.

00:21:53.578 --> 00:21:59.616
s'iz geven arumgeringlt dos plats mit, oykh mit di shtekh- mit di, mit di

00:21:59.616 --> 00:22:00.862
drotn

00:22:01.780 --> 00:22:05.708
es iz geven gemakht di dr- lebn der drot iz geshtanen.

00:22:05.708 --> 00:22:08.540
vaser hot zikh gegosn azoy, fun a

00:22:09.002 --> 00:22:12.610
fun a shtikl ni- nisht a kernitse, nisht

00:22:12.610 --> 00:22:17.383
s'iz g- s'hot zikh gegosn vaser fun, fun, fun ayz, fun a shtikl ayz

00:22:17.693 --> 00:22:19.729
nor s'iz geven in yener zayt.

00:22:20.545 --> 00:22:23.301
nisht in der zayt, az me zol kenen trinken.

00:22:23.301 --> 00:22:26.220
s'iz geven dortn, az me zol kukn oyf dem vaser

00:22:26.220 --> 00:22:28.183
un me zol khaleshn un shtarbn.

00:22:29.590 --> 00:22:32.182
ikh gedenk vi a meydele

00:22:32.374 --> 00:22:35.422
a kind, efsher fun finef zeks yor

00:22:35.698 --> 00:22:37.138
iz zi hot zikh

00:22:37.138 --> 00:22:39.371
ged- gekrokhn

00:22:39.445 --> 00:22:42.763
tsugekrokhn tsu d- vu s'iz geven dos drot

00:22:42.887 --> 00:22:47.893
un hot gevolt mit der hant, hot zi gevolt a bisl vaser onnemen, hot men zi geshosn

00:22:49.232 --> 00:22:50.441
oyfn plats.

00:22:52.000 --> 00:22:55.506
der ho- der HOCH gebildeter ofitser

00:22:55.506 --> 00:22:57.596
oyb dos heyst a gebildeter man

00:22:57.619 --> 00:23:00.093
hot oysgeshtelt di ale mentshn

00:23:00.488 --> 00:23:02.406
un hot gemakht selektsyes.

00:23:02.648 --> 00:23:06.610
dos heyst ver s'iz im gefeln gevo- ver s'hot nokh gekent epes arbetn

00:23:06.610 --> 00:23:08.616
ver s'hot nokh gekent epes tun

00:23:08.689 --> 00:23:16.845
iz zey zenen in eyn zayt, alte in eyn zayt, di yingere in eyn zayt, un di mener in eyn zayt, un froy- mener, s'iz nisht geven keyn mener.

00:23:16.845 --> 00:23:19.382
froyen, eltere froyen, yingere.

00:23:19.877 --> 00:23:23.820
mayn shvester LIZA hot mikh avekgeshtelt far zikh

00:23:25.311 --> 00:23:27.662
un ven er iz tsugekumen

00:23:27.662 --> 00:23:31.549
azoy iz er gegangen un fleg makhn mit der, mit der nagayke

00:23:34.913 --> 00:23:38.417
derfar gedenk ikh di oygn zayne. ikh vel zey nisht fargesn.

00:23:38.440 --> 00:23:41.623
hot zi im gezogt, azoy kukndik in di oygn, hot zi gezogt

00:23:42.034 --> 00:23:45.651
"du vest gibn a shis azoy

00:23:45.651 --> 00:23:49.757
az di pulye zol durkhgeyn durkh mir un durkh mayn shvester.

00:23:50.134 --> 00:23:53.387
du vest UNK undz keyn mol nisht tseteyln.

00:23:53.387 --> 00:23:58.008
mir veln mir zayn nor tsuzamen. du vest gibn a shis

00:23:58.234 --> 00:24:02.635
az s'zol durkhgeyn mir mit mayn shvester tsuzamen."

00:24:02.635 --> 00:24:03.999
er iz geblibn

00:24:04.461 --> 00:24:07.444
kukndik azoy. er hot nisht farshtanen

00:24:07.444 --> 00:24:10.023
un zi hot geredt zeyer sheyn daytsh, mayn shvester

00:24:11.363 --> 00:24:13.972
iz, iz er geblibn shteyn a moment

00:24:14.367 --> 00:24:18.692
un hot gegibn a gutn hak undz beyde mit der nagayke un hot undz avekgeshikt

00:24:18.692 --> 00:24:21.600
in der zayt vu es zenen geblibn di mentshn tsu arbet.

00:24:25.335 --> 00:24:28.181
dos iz geven a aktsye fun a inteligentn mentshn.

00:24:29.824 --> 00:24:34.504
m- mit vemen hobn zey ge- geha- mit vemen hobn zey gehat? mit, mit kranke

00:24:34.504 --> 00:24:38.677
tsemishte, koytike, mit vemen ⟨zey⟩ hobn gemakht di milkhomes.

00:24:40.185 --> 00:24:43.284
m'hot undz tsurikgeshikt

00:24:43.392 --> 00:24:47.334
zikher veyniker shoyn geven mentshn, tsurikgeshikt in dem geto

00:24:47.391 --> 00:24:48.802
in Kopaygorod.

00:24:48.808 --> 00:24:50.894
dos iz shoyn geven dos

00:24:51.053 --> 00:24:53.038
ende tsvey un fertsik

00:24:54.445 --> 00:24:58.559
un m'hot undz geshikt tsu di rumenishe soldatn tsu

00:24:58.559 --> 00:25:01.343
tsu vashn un kokhn un

00:25:01.343 --> 00:25:02.499
un

00:25:02.499 --> 00:25:05.019
un in di kazarmen makhn reyn

00:25:05.143 --> 00:25:07.786
un shlogn un harb- hargenen un shlogn

00:25:07.995 --> 00:25:11.873
vos heyst geshlogn? az s'iz nisht geven faranen a moment az ⟨vos du zolst⟩

00:25:11.873 --> 00:25:16.201
du zolst kenen a minut lebn, me zol dikh nit shlogn, shlogn un hargenen.

00:25:16.201 --> 00:25:18.350
khoyzek makhn, shlogn, un hargenen.

00:25:20.972 --> 00:25:25.488
mir iz shoyn geven alts eyns. ikh hob bikhlal shoyn nisht gefilt ven m'hot mikh geshlogn.

00:25:26.187 --> 00:25:28.644
di shvester hot mikh geshlept.

00:25:30.507 --> 00:25:33.504
nor ikh meyn az

00:25:33.510 --> 00:25:37.098
trots dem dos d- a yunger kerper

00:25:38.202 --> 00:25:39.799
un

00:25:39.990 --> 00:25:43.809
un di por gute yidis- di, di yorn vos ikh hob gehat in der heym

00:25:43.809 --> 00:25:45.586
bin ikh geblibn lebn.

00:25:46.082 --> 00:25:48.320
un ikh bin gekumen tsu zikh.

00:25:49.677 --> 00:25:53.366
ikh gedenk mayn shvester, zol ⟨zikh⟩ mien, fleg geyn bay nakht

00:25:53.524 --> 00:25:56.111
fleg zi mir o- oysredn

00:25:56.111 --> 00:25:58.075
un zogn "⟨tustu zen⟩

00:25:59.076 --> 00:26:01.891
⟨tustu zen⟩. mir ⟨veln⟩ mir zikh tsunoyfkumen

00:26:01.891 --> 00:26:04.962
mit di eygene, di brider, di shvester

00:26:04.962 --> 00:26:06.844
vest geyn vider lernen."

00:26:06.844 --> 00:26:08.807
ikh hob zeyer lib gehat shprakhn

00:26:08.847 --> 00:26:09.797
historye

00:26:09.797 --> 00:26:12.620
"vest lernen, vest, mir veln mir dikh sheyn ontun

00:26:12.762 --> 00:26:15.068
un m'vet dir koyfn sheyne kleydelekh

00:26:15.225 --> 00:26:17.188
un d'vest, d'vest esn."

00:26:17.188 --> 00:26:19.711
ikh hob ⟨POTATO⟩ hob ikh lib gehat un broyt.

00:26:19.711 --> 00:26:22.796
"vest, vest esn. vest vern a mentsh."

00:26:24.490 --> 00:26:25.564
nor

00:26:25.907 --> 00:26:31.031
ikh meyn az geratevet hot mikh dos vos m'hot undz ibergeshikt in a andern geto.

00:26:31.189 --> 00:26:34.608
dos iz shoyn geven dos fe- der ferder geto, di CONCENTRATI-

00:26:36.133 --> 00:26:38.607
dos iz geven Tultshin.

00:26:39.576 --> 00:26:42.112
dos iz geven TRANSNISTRIA.

00:26:42.112 --> 00:26:44.969
dos iz geven der, der Bug

00:26:45.583 --> 00:26:48.524
di, der, der, der taykh hot geheysn Bug.

00:26:48.524 --> 00:26:51.866
dos iz geven fun DNESTRU, NISTRU biz dem Bug

00:26:51.866 --> 00:26:55.164
dos iz geven di TRANSNISTRIA, di CLOACA vos

00:26:55.164 --> 00:26:57.865
vos m'hot umgekumen di, di yidn.

00:26:57.865 --> 00:27:00.228
dos iz geven dos plats vu

00:27:00.228 --> 00:27:01.712
vu m'hot azoy

00:27:01.712 --> 00:27:03.042
langzam

00:27:03.100 --> 00:27:05.206
mit sadizm

00:27:05.206 --> 00:27:08.848
geharget di yidn fun Besarabye un Bukovine.

00:27:09.597 --> 00:27:13.255
dos bisele, di, di, dos bisele di yidn vos zenen geblibn

00:27:13.255 --> 00:27:15.002
lebn, dos hot men zey

00:27:15.002 --> 00:27:18.756
n- dernokh hot mayn shvester gezogt az s'iz shoyn geven

00:27:18.756 --> 00:27:22.938
s'iz shoyn nisht geven ⟨vuhin tsu tun⟩, hot men undz gedarft shikn in di gas.

00:27:24.632 --> 00:27:27.292
in dray un fertsikstn yor

00:27:27.670 --> 00:27:32.468
hot men undz tsunoyfgetribn in di koytike vagonen in tsug

00:27:32.468 --> 00:27:34.223
vu me fleg firn di

00:27:35.432 --> 00:27:38.446
di, di khazeyrim mit di kien mit di ferd

00:27:38.588 --> 00:27:43.560
naket un borves un hungerik un shleferik un bikhlal nisht keyn mentshn

00:27:43.566 --> 00:27:47.812
un m'hot undz geshi- zey hobn, m'hot undz gebrakht keyn Tultshin.

00:27:47.987 --> 00:27:52.489
dos hot men undz geshikt di, di yunge vos m'hot nokh gekent epes fun zey

00:27:52.489 --> 00:27:53.899
hobn epes a hilf

00:27:53.899 --> 00:27:56.402
hot men geshikt tsu grobn dem torf.

00:27:57.707 --> 00:28:02.935
dos iz geven geto Tultshin, TRANSNISTRIA, lebn dem Bug.

00:28:02.935 --> 00:28:04.994
dortn zenen geven di rumener

00:28:04.994 --> 00:28:09.496
un geveyntlekh di daytshn, nor ge- di, di balebatim zenen geven di rumener.

00:28:11.595 --> 00:28:14.862
in Tultshin iz geven dray pletser fun arbet.

00:28:15.308 --> 00:28:19.521
di, dos hoypt plats, dos vikhtikste plats iz geven torf

00:28:24.218 --> 00:28:26.038
vu me fleg shteyn in

00:28:26.038 --> 00:28:29.053
in kalt, shmutsik vaser

00:28:29.053 --> 00:28:31.620
biz, biz di gantse fis

00:28:33.364 --> 00:28:37.748
un dos tsveyte plats iz geven ⟨DNESTER VARKA⟩

00:28:37.748 --> 00:28:40.074
dos iz geven a tsigl fabrik

00:28:41.329 --> 00:28:45.086
un dos drite plats iz geven i- in der shtot Tultshin

00:28:45.193 --> 00:28:48.849
vu s- ikh veys nisht tsi s'iz geven

00:28:48.973 --> 00:28:52.916
a, a tseha- a tseshmeterte SYNAGOGUE

00:28:53.057 --> 00:28:58.150
tsi m'hot es gerufn SINAGOGA, nor s'hot geheysn az me traybt di mentshn in der SINAGOGA

00:28:58.150 --> 00:28:59.851
iz geven torf

00:29:00.178 --> 00:29:02.521
s'iz geven DNESTER VARKA

00:29:02.521 --> 00:29:05.187
vu s'iz geven di tsigl fabrik. es iz geven

00:29:05.187 --> 00:29:08.174
di SYNAGOGUE in, in shtot Tultshin.
